# Brand & copy

- Factual constants (tuition, weeks, dates, structure, **outcome stats**) live in `lib/site.ts`.
- **Messaging guide (funnel + parent copy):** `docs/messaging-guide.md` — enforced by `.cursor/rules/messaging-guide.mdc`.
- Voice: warm, clear, parent-friendly; avoid "cohort."
- SAT angles: `docs/sat-messaging-positioning.md`; voice: `docs/brand-voice-and-positioning.md`.
- Banned phrases: `.cursor/rules/banned-copy-phrases.mdc`.
- When changing hero or program facts, sync `docs/` if positioning text references them.
- Tutor interview scheduling is invite-only — see `lib/internal-links.ts`.
